<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS DUE WEEK NOV 25.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS DUE WEEK NOV 25.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch</p>
<p>company results for week beginning Monday, Nov 25 include:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-------PERIOD--PFT/DIV--CONSENSUS--RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p> 27/11 Nedlloyd	Q3	PFT	 28.7	20-38	23</p>
<p> 27/11 Ahold	   Q3	PFT	157.7	134-169.6 101.6</p>
<p> 28/11 Fortis in ecu Nine M  PFT	549.2	526-561   469.0</p>
<p> 28/11 Fortis Amev   Nine M  PFT	598	  577-615   518.7</p>
<p>Profit figures are net profits before extraordinary items</p>
<p>and in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. This</p>
<p>forecast includes two estimates for Fortis, one in guilders for</p>
<p>Fortis Amev and one in ecus for Fortis.</p>
<p>Securities houses surveyed included: Amstgeld, Bangert</p>
<p>Pontier, BZW, Delta Lloyd Bank, ING Barings, IRIS, Generale</p>
<p>Bank, Kempen &amp; Co, NIBStrating, Labouchere, and Wesselius.</p>
<p>NOTE - Banks and brokers interested in contributing to</p>
<p>Reuters surveys can contact the Amsterdam newsroom on</p>
<p>+31-20-504-5000 or fax their forecasts to +31-20-504 5040.</p>
<p>Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (FAX 31-20-504-5040)</p>
</text>
